---
import '../../styles/global.css'
import site from '../../content/pages/site.json'

// Isolated English pilot. No language switcher or changes to Hebrew routes.
// Keep the page out of search results until the translation and navigation are approved.
const title = 'About Yossi Medalsi | Heart Compass'
const description = 'Emotional coaching in Hebrew for Israelis and Jewish families living abroad. Support with relocation, relationships, parenting and finding your footing in a new country.'
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Assistant:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground" style="font-family: Assistant, sans-serif">
    <header class="border-b border-foreground/10 bg-white/80">
      <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/en/about" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-primary">Heart Compass</a>
        <a href="/about" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4" lang="he" dir="rtl">עברית</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 md:py-24">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">About Heart Compass</p>
          <h1 class="mb-7 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-primary md:text-6xl">You moved abroad. Life moved with you.</h1>
          <p class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed text-primary">A new country can offer a fresh start. It can also bring old fears, family tensions and questions about where you belong into sharper focus.</p>
          <p class="mb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed">I'm Yossi Medalsi, founder of Heart Compass. I work with Israelis and Jewish individuals and families living abroad, including people navigating relocation, relationships, parenting and major life changes. Our sessions are available online, in Hebrew.</p>
          <p class="mb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed">Moving countries doesn't automatically change the way we react when we're hurt, overwhelmed or afraid. You may know exactly what you want to do, yet find yourself withdrawing, arguing, second-guessing yourself or putting things off. Together, we look at what drives those reactions and work on changing them, so you have more say in what happens next.</p>
          <p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">I believe real progress shows up in everyday choices: having a difficult conversation, setting a boundary, helping your child through a tough transition or taking a step you've been avoiding. You don't need to know how everything will turn out to trust yourself to face it.</p>
          <a href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsAppPhone}`} class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary px-7 py-3 font-bold text-white hover:opacity-90">Let's talk on WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-8 border-white shadow-xl">
          <img src="/assets/yossi-about.jpg" alt="Yossi Medalsi, founder of Heart Compass" width="800" height="1000" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="mt-16 rounded-3xl bg-white/70 p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary">How we work together</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">At Heart Compass, I use a three-stage approach: first, we identify the reactions and beliefs that keep showing up in your life. Then we work with what sits underneath them, rather than relying on willpower alone. Finally, we build your confidence in making decisions and following through, even when things feel uncertain.</p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">Whether you're settling into a new country, feeling distant from your partner, or trying to support a child who misses home, the work is about what changes in your life between sessions, not just what we talk about during them.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="border-t border-foreground/10 px-6 py-8 text-center text-sm text-foreground/70">
      <p>Heart Compass · Yossi Medalsi</p>
      <a href="/about" class="mt-2 inline-block underline underline-offset-4">Read the Hebrew about page</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
